<Base title="Babel | Henrique Menezzo" description="Product Designer focused on UI/UX, Design Systems and SaaS. Experience working with startups, complex platforms and business-impact oriented design." page="babel">
<div style="min-height:100vh;width:auto" class="f-k5j8qd"><div class="f-15gjmdt-container"><div class="ssr-variant hidden-1vifm64"><nav style="width:100%" class="f-kggwsa"><a href="/#hero" style="background-color:#fff;box-shadow:0px 1px 40px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-radius:800px" aria-label="Back to home" class="f-1mz2u42 f-1bqaie"><div class="f-1kna6q1-container"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" focusable="false" color="var(--token-b740f1d8-819f-424e-8ed4-13557f40bfa1, rgb(0, 0, 0))" width="100%" height="100%"><g color="var(--token-b740f1d8-819f-424e-8ed4-13557f40bfa1, rgb(0, 0, 0))" weight="regular"><path d="M205.66,194.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31,61.66,205.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,50.34,61.66A8,8,0,0,1,61.66,50.34L128,116.69l66.34-66.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L139.31,128Z"></path></g></svg></div></a></nav></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-1u4xt95 hidden-k5j8qd hidden-irf5wf hidden-umbafv hidden-19ytj83"><nav style="width:100%" class="f-kggwsa f-v-1rpijcw"><a href="/#hero" style="background-color:#fff;box-shadow:0px 1px 40px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-radius:800px" aria-label="Back to home" class="f-1mz2u42 f-1bqaie"><div class="f-1kna6q1-container"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" focusable="false" color="var(--token-b740f1d8-819f-424e-8ed4-13557f40bfa1, rgb(0, 0, 0))" width="100%" height="100%"><g color="var(--token-b740f1d8-819f-424e-8ed4-13557f40bfa1, rgb(0, 0, 0))" weight="regular"><path d="M205.66,194.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31,61.66,205.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,50.34,61.66A8,8,0,0,1,61.66,50.34L128,116.69l66.34-66.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L139.31,128Z"></path></g></svg></div></a></nav></div></div><div id="hero" class="f-h7z8hj"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-01-1945.avif 1945w, /img/babel-01-3889.avif 3889w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 100vw, (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 100vw, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 767.98px) 100vw"><img src="/img/babel-01-3889.webp" srcset="/img/babel-01-1945.webp 1945w, /img/babel-01-3889.webp 3889w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 100vw, (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 100vw, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 767.98px) 100vw" width="3889" height="3207" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div data-speed="50" class="f-1jmkct"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-02-1441.avif 1441w, /img/babel-02-2881.avif 2881w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 1186px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1318px, calc(100vw * 1318 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 938px, (max-width: 767.98px) 740px"><img src="/img/babel-02-2881.webp" srcset="/img/babel-02-1441.webp 1441w, /img/babel-02-2881.webp 2881w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 1186px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1318px, calc(100vw * 1318 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 938px, (max-width: 767.98px) 740px" width="2881" height="1679" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"></picture></div><div style="transform:scale(1.08)" class="f-hhtohu a-settle"></div><div class="f-cgktg8"><div class="f-cyv1kr rt a-rise"><h1 class="p-2d95uh t1">Babel</h1></div><div class="f-133vl4h rt a-rise"><h2 class="p-1sbqppe t1">Removing friction from legal workflows and forms with applied AI.</h2></div></div></div><div class="f-17rod3w"><div class="f-5963u0 hidden-1u4xt95 b1"><div class="f-9yf255"><div class="f-m0ym5n rt"><p class="t2">My role</p></div><div class="f-hkrno7 rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b2">Product Designer</p></div></div><div class="f-v79h3h"><div class="f-1eph301 rt"><p style="font-family:var(--medium);color:#000;font-weight:500" class="b3">Challenge</p></div><div class="f-11ng7qs rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b4">Reduce and simplify the flow by replicating manual data entry in forms</p></div></div><div class="f-flihnp"><div class="f-13wxnf6 rt"><p style="font-family:var(--medium);color:#000;font-weight:500" class="b5">Result</p></div><div class="f-16ohcta rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b6">40% reduction in time spent filling repeated information</p></div></div><div class="f-mnb82"><div class="f-myt40g rt"><p style="font-family:var(--medium);color:#000;font-weight:500" class="b7">Deliverables</p></div><div class="f-1a1dowq rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b8">Product Design, Personas, Benchmarking, Surveys, UX Strategy, Prototype, Prototyping, Usability Testing</p></div></div></div><div class="f-1y7qwsu"><div data-speed="108" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="104" class="f-8sl69l b9"><div class="f-p9rkua"><div class="f-1xg5mrn"></div></div><div class="f-r8k08y rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b10">In the daily routine, lawyers and law firms spend hours replicating client information in spreadsheets or filling out extensive forms in traditional legal systems.</p><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b11">These ERPs, in most cases, are not designed from the perspective of design and the real experience of the lawyer, which makes the work slower, more confusing, and more exhausting.</p></div></div><div class="f-16pt2tf"><div data-speed="96" data-speed-t="98" data-speed-p="104" class="f-sexaoo rt"><p class="t3">During the research, we found that lawyers had low satisfaction (2/5) with legal platforms and took 5 to 10 minutes to fill out task, case, or client forms.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">The workflow was marked by rework and redundant forms, with information copied between systems without intelligence or fluidity.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">User feedback:</p><p class="t3">“The deadline and schedule management is excellent, but feeding the system takes too long.”</p></div><div class="f-1mob0a7 hidden-irf5wf"><div style="transform:translateX(-50%)" data-speed="101" class="f-lbkisl"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-03-984.avif 984w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(497px, 701.3663px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(585px, calc(100vw * 585 / 1500)), max(701.3663px, calc(100vw * 701.3663 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(792px, 701.3663px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(419px, 701.3663px)"><img src="/img/babel-03-984.webp" srcset="/img/babel-03-984.webp 984w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(497px, 701.3663px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(585px, calc(100vw * 585 / 1500)), max(701.3663px, calc(100vw * 701.3663 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(792px, 701.3663px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(419px, 701.3663px)" width="984" height="468" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div style="transform:translateX(-50%)" data-speed="99" class="f-zryxui"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-04-552.avif 552w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(303px, 408.6974px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(353px, calc(100vw * 353 / 1500)), max(408.6974px, calc(100vw * 408.6974 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(400px, 408.6974px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(205px, 408.6974px)"><img src="/img/babel-04-552.webp" srcset="/img/babel-04-552.webp 552w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(303px, 408.6974px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(353px, calc(100vw * 353 / 1500)), max(408.6974px, calc(100vw * 408.6974 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(400px, 408.6974px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(205px, 408.6974px)" width="552" height="526" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div><div class="f-rp3izw hidden-k5j8qd hidden-umbafv hidden-1vifm64 hidden-19ytj83 hidden-1u4xt95"><div style="transform:translateY(-50%)" data-speed="50" class="f-blh9bz"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-03-984.avif 984w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(497px, 701.3663px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(585px, calc(100vw * 585 / 1500)), max(701.3663px, calc(100vw * 701.3663 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(792px, 701.3663px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(419px, 701.3663px)"><img src="/img/babel-03-984.webp" srcset="/img/babel-03-984.webp 984w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(497px, 701.3663px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(585px, calc(100vw * 585 / 1500)), max(701.3663px, calc(100vw * 701.3663 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(792px, 701.3663px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(419px, 701.3663px)" width="984" height="468" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div data-speed="50" class="f-nrfdkn"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-04-552.avif 552w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(303px, 408.6974px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(353px, calc(100vw * 353 / 1500)), max(408.6974px, calc(100vw * 408.6974 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(400px, 408.6974px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(205px, 408.6974px)"><img src="/img/babel-04-552.webp" srcset="/img/babel-04-552.webp 552w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) max(303px, 408.6974px), (min-width: 1440px) max(max(353px, calc(100vw * 353 / 1500)), max(408.6974px, calc(100vw * 408.6974 / 1500))), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) max(400px, 408.6974px), (max-width: 767.98px) max(205px, 408.6974px)" width="552" height="526" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div></div></div><div class="f-erxqfo"><div data-speed="104" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="101" class="f-mi9gt5 b12"><div class="f-hqde9d"><div class="f-bnepog"></div></div><div class="f-1mro3ho"><div class="f-fb2uhh rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b13">How to reduce friction in such a complex system?</p></div><div class="f-1pyih38 rt"><p class="t3">The main challenge was to visually reduce the density of the forms and the interface as a whole.</p><p class="t3">Existing legal systems were extremely overloaded with text and data-filled fields that, although necessary, made the experience tiring and not very fluid for lawyers.</p></div></div></div><div class="f-193iw3r"><div data-speed="96" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="100" class="f-9ka8go rt b14"><p class="t3">My first step was to understand how to simplify without compromising functionality.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">To achieve this, I explored visual patterns inspired by tools like Linear and Notion, known for presenting large amounts of information in a light, organized, and pleasant way.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">The idea was to bring that same clarity to the legal context, making the completion of tasks and everyday forms much faster and more natural.</p></div><div class="f-bea1iw"><div data-speed="104" class="f-1vqcydp"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-05-1034.avif 1034w, /img/babel-05-2067.avif 2067w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(764px, calc(100vw * 764 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 764px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 736px, (max-width: 767.98px) 515px"><img src="/img/babel-05-2067.webp" srcset="/img/babel-05-1034.webp 1034w, /img/babel-05-2067.webp 2067w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(764px, calc(100vw * 764 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 764px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 736px, (max-width: 767.98px) 515px" width="2067" height="1550" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div></div></div><div class="f-19tlz31"><div class="f-1mbmq4q"><div data-speed="102" data-speed-p="101" class="f-q8jnwa"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-06-1371.avif 1371w, /img/babel-06-2741.avif 2741w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 925px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1015px, calc(100vw * 1015 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 716px, (max-width: 767.98px) 601px"><img src="/img/babel-06-2741.webp" srcset="/img/babel-06-1371.webp 1371w, /img/babel-06-2741.webp 2741w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 925px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1015px, calc(100vw * 1015 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 716px, (max-width: 767.98px) 601px" width="2741" height="1592" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div><div data-speed="96" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="100" class="f-5bwj68 rt b15"><p class="t3">During our research, we discovered that most lawyers use WhatsApp as their main communication channel with clients.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">From this insight, together with the engineering team, we designed an AI-powered solution that transforms WhatsApp conversations into tasks, documents, cases, or client records within the system.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">This feature eliminated several manual steps and connected lawyers’ real routines to Babel’s digital workflow.</p></div></div><div class="f-6ce8bi"><div class="f-1if2ko6"><div class="f-1tvgly2-container"><video data-src="/video/babel-10.mp4" data-poster="/video/babel-10.avif" width="1794" height="1042" loop="" muted="" playsinline="" preload="none"></video></div></div></div><div class="f-3k72bp"><div data-speed="102" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="101" class="f-zft2vp b16"><div class="f-9i1iuo"><div class="f-1unvzql"></div></div><div class="f-1lpvy1t"><div class="f-m5y3z1 rt"><p style="font-family:var(--book);line-height:1.5;color:#000" class="b17">Increasing lawyers’ productivity</p></div><div class="f-1629hrp rt"><p class="t3">After the usability tests, we adjusted flows, removed redundancies, and simplified forms that previously required multiple steps. The result was a more straightforward system, with fewer distractions and greater clarity in every action.</p><p class="t3">As a result, lawyers began completing everyday tasks much faster and with less cognitive effort, making their daily work smoother and more predictable.</p></div></div></div><div class="f-18iwoaa"><div class="f-1wdjys2"><div class="f-1ni9zl4"><div data-speed="102" data-speed-p="101" class="f-parfdg"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-07-1441.avif 1441w, /img/babel-07-2881.avif 2881w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 1179px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1276px, calc(100vw * 1276 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 996px, (max-width: 767.98px) 750px"><img src="/img/babel-07-2881.webp" srcset="/img/babel-07-1441.webp 1441w, /img/babel-07-2881.webp 2881w" sizes="(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 1179px, (min-width: 1440px) max(1276px, calc(100vw * 1276 / 1500)), (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 996px, (max-width: 767.98px) 750px" width="2881" height="1679" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div></div><div data-speed="96" data-speed-t="100" data-speed-p="101" class="f-1ewnb41 rt b18"><p class="t3">The average time spent on repetitive tasks was reduced by more than 40% after implementing the improvements.</p><p class="t4"><br></p><p class="t3">Process automation and the use of AI to transform conversations into tasks eliminated manual steps, allowing lawyers to focus on what truly matters: analyzing, deciding, and serving their clients more efficiently.</p></div></div><div class="f-1dnkof9"><div class="f-161dw6n"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-08-1107.avif 1107w, /img/babel-08-2214.avif 2214w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(820px, calc(100vw * 820 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 820px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 621px, (max-width: 767.98px) 299px"><img src="/img/babel-08-2214.webp" srcset="/img/babel-08-1107.webp 1107w, /img/babel-08-2214.webp 2214w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(820px, calc(100vw * 820 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 820px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 621px, (max-width: 767.98px) 299px" width="2214" height="1186" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div><div class="f-lk8g9b"><div data-speed="104" data-speed-p="102" class="f-f2roji"><picture class="bg"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/img/babel-09-1348.avif 1348w, /img/babel-09-2695.avif 2695w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(998px, calc(100vw * 998 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 998px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 625px, (max-width: 767.98px) 601px"><img src="/img/babel-09-2695.webp" srcset="/img/babel-09-1348.webp 1348w, /img/babel-09-2695.webp 2695w" sizes="(min-width: 1440px) max(998px, calc(100vw * 998 / 1500)), (min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1439.98px) 998px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 625px, (max-width: 767.98px) 601px" width="2695" height="1595" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy"></picture></div></div><div data-speed="99" class="f-rpj8xk rt"><p class="t3">Spending hours using the system as if I were a lawyer made me truly understand what it’s like to live that daily routine, the repetitions, the habits, and even the small annoyances that no one notices.</p><p class="t3">It was in this “dogfooding” process that I realized how much visual ergonomics, clarity, and predictability are fundamental in an ERP. The simpler and more direct the system is, the more naturally it fits into the user’s routine.</p><p class="t3">This immersion made me see that great products aren’t born only from research, but from truly experiencing what the user lives every day.</p></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-1vifm64"><div data-cursor